muLwlSp--44Q7kNvwF2bU92&_nc_oc=AdpFVdSLeTRKOgsJ_1AkTq5Q2fVltEG4cukBfy3_DA_SSEjiaoceuSAr1p998NkWJ4s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af84BX6b9vzXUwuS2L4gITVSa1wF7rDTF9QbZzn2zRoMlw&oe=6A3008B7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aickd5bQyLwQ7kNvwG4F_rS&_nc_oc=AdrWKvzykgNyyL5ATzocfPr1kxvrKgSpGBXusWi69X3kaEDewc_5BXEU8C8o4WK1KNo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-RfQ2zyLEeHABfc9anhcFGvrV68Zbu5-cQjk2IlbrVzQ&oe=6A300A4A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8L0K2Qk7YTEQ7kNvwF34gqE&_nc_oc=Adr1DlPggsJ3y3f6Nx0UINoLTPT7u2U8gxFSPFwDWaNMQjaHNOcUYIbkuOC0qxoY-_Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8Vh1mW92NNX01RBq7fQgmw8imOdSq6XHd8gIoRY1bj3A&oe=6A2FF76F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=msRtVTMklxkQ7kNvwH53mat&_nc_oc=AdqGng7ifusZt0eq3hLZ3G4LdG7VPCLWxFJ6Mp79Y_ID4OsWs4LL-xZFopCYeC4F1dY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-M102ZJkuYMF0stAY9LjSJOOzhYoQSoW5ljAcqHrLcPg&oe=6A301903"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yglQoXPIYf8Q7kNvwGYzloW&_nc_oc=AdqqEhACkIgyvOQbZ7Hv2ta-0XPWM1uhivqnqXC4W0U84_4J2iA6KYYNifnU4BJJGjc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-BtJMdyQnrM_PsRQa_4Gmd07JJBid5cN7-JiIc0V26Ig&oe=6A301158"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aIpDji_1qdAQ7kNvwFliHGH&_nc_oc=Adp5IR308rzP9e2PY7GO8SyFR3U3tie_EaADi26rML-KP5sjVM4k1ACqIOj1CSD2hV4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8K-BgRPAdhVdZNXE2R4YqEySDkTPhW6JVGIF9iw3KXIA&oe=6A30247C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080